[[Refined Homestead Wood]] is a [[crafting material]] used for [[Homestead]] [[Decoration|decorations]]. It is obtained by refining common [[wood]] types at the [[Homestead Refinement—Lumber Mill]]. Up to 200 refined Homestead wood can be initially obtained by refining wood every week. This limit can be permanently increased by purchasing [[Homestead Upgrade: Wood Trade Capacity|wood trade capacity upgrades]] at the Homestead Refinement—Lumber Mill.

Refined Homestead wood can also be bought with [[coin]]s on the Black Market tab of the Homestead Refinement—Lumber Mill. The black market prices increase after each purchase but reset back to the original price after every [[weekly reset]]. Refined Homestead wood bought this way doesn't count towards the weekly cap.

== Acquisition ==
=== Sold by ===
The exchange rate of wood to refined Homestead wood can be improved by purchasing wood trade efficiency upgrades at the [[Homestead Refinement—Lumber Mill]].
